msgid ""
"Welcome to the second episode of the *Quarkus Newsletter*. This is where "
"we'll post about new found publications related to Quarkus."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you feel something is missing or have an article coming out for future "
"Quarkus Newsletter posts please https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkusio."
"github.io/issues[open an issue] with a short description and a url."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This time there was a lot of news around our 1.0 announcement; I've not "
"included those unless they added something extra - that still leaves us with "
"a new interesting workshop, articles from community members and a lot of "
"great videos from Devoxx Belgium."
msgstr ""

msgid "Enjoy!"
msgstr ""
